This is a plain-language summary. The legal license is the text at the URL above.

Once you publish a version under this license, people who received it may keep
sharing that version on these terms. Choose the license before the first public
post. If you would rather others not sell your books, switch the license in
series.yaml to CC BY-NC 4.0 before you publish, and use that license URL:

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

The preview audio in dist/audio is a private editing aid. Read
publishing/audio.md before you upload any generated voice.
